spell checker uses. They are redistributed in every packaged build. Each was
downloaded from the immutable release below and copied out unmodified;
manifest.json beside them records the archive URL, its version, the SHA-256 of the
archive as downloaded and the SHA-256 of every extracted file, and a test recomputes
those file hashes on each run. PROVENANCE.md in the same folder carries the same
