segmentation.


LEGACY SPELLCHECK DICTIONARIES

Mnemo.Infrastructure/Dictionaries/Spellcheck/ holds an older set of Hunspell
dictionary files (.aff/.dic pairs) for en, de, es, and nb, reached through
ISpellcheckService. Nothing resolves that service, and the publish step excludes the
whole folder, so none of these files are redistributed in a built copy of Mnemo. They
are superseded by the proofing dictionaries above and are kept only until that path
has been proven in the field.

Their licenses were never cleared, which is why they are not shipped: de.aff states
in its own header, "Copyright (C) 1998-2015 Bjoern Jacke <bjoern@j3e.de>", derived
from the igerman98 dictionary, "License: GPLv2, GPLv3", while en, es, and nb carry no
license header of their own and their provenance could not be established from the
files themselves.


